{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1547002-ideas-for-playing-as-a-first-team","id":1547002,"title":"Ideas for playing as a First Team","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-12-14T14:17:50-08:00","id":1547002,"title":"Ideas for playing as a First Team","content":"I like to think of First Teams as having a mixed vibe between the Colonial Marines from Aliens and the Umbrella Security Service from Resident Evil. So, it would make sense to start off simple with stories where you have to clean up Pentex's messes. Like say that a facility is attacked by Renegade Freakfeet. Or maybe you have to deal with a Yeren who got too big for his britches? Maybe hunting down some escaped Samsa or Giant Fomori bugs accidentally created by a chemical spill? Then you later get to fight things like the Garou or the mysterious Inquisitors. The Book of the Wyrm also mentions the possibility of aliens and since the Book of Madness mentions Greys as bygones this could work too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28613,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","user":"Samuelalpha86","date":". 10-30-2025, 05:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}